<title>SWEDEN: Peab signs deal with Kemira unit.</title>
<headline>Peab signs deal with Kemira unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company Peab said on Tuesday it signed a five-year maintenance and service agreement with Kemira Kemi, a Swedish unit of Finland's Kemira, worth a total of 550 million crowns.</p>
<p>Peab will take over responsibility for Kemira Kemi's plant maintenance from Kemira. The annual cost of the work is estimated at 110 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
